================================================================================
3. Statement of changes  (Apache-2.0 section 4(b))
================================================================================

No file from either source is redistributed unchanged. The derived material was
modified as follows:

  * The two project-specific custom-property prefixes (--aris-* and --wm-*) were
    replaced by a single --ds-* prefix, and several tokens were renamed:
    primary-dark -> primary-hover, ink -> fg, text -> fg-body,
    primary-light -> primary-tint, warning -> accent.

  * Rules specific to one project were removed: ARIS.jl's .aris-math display-equation
    block was generalized to .ds-math, wm-physics-eval's .wm-flow diagram row was
    dropped, and its .wm-hf-logo rule was generalized to .ds-resource-logo with no
    accompanying image.

  * The hard-coded colour values were replaced by template variables and extracted
    into palette files, and six tokens (primary-tint, accent-text, accent-tint,
    bg-translucent, link, link-hover) became derived values computed at generation
    time, with accent-text contrast-corrected automatically.

  * The stylesheet became a Jinja2 template rendered per project, and the whole was
    reorganized into a generator with a configuration schema, an ownership manifest
    and an update planner, none of which exist in either source.

  * The workflow template gained a conditional checker step and a configurable
    trigger, and no longer installs the documented package.


================================================================================
4. Material original to this project
================================================================================

Written for docs-studio and not derived from either source:

  * all of src/docs_studio/ other than the parts named in sections 1 and 2 — the CLI,
    the configuration schema, the colour and contrast arithmetic, the asset handling
    and monogram generator, the ownership manifest, and the update planner;
  * the neutral and studio-teal palettes;
  * brand/docs-studio-*.svg and examples/brand/lattice-*.svg;
  * the documentation under docs/ and the example sites under examples/;
  * the test suite.

Referenced but not redistributed: Zensical (https://zensical.org) is a pinned
dependency, not vendored; the simple-*, lucide/* and material/* icon shortcodes in
generated pages resolve to icons shipped with its theme at build time; no icon or font
file is included here, and generated sites set font = false and use system fonts.


